    "description": "<p><i>Reference Book: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Star_Wars_Saga_Edition_Dawn_of_Defiance\" title=\"Star Wars Saga Edition Dawn of Defiance\">Star Wars Saga Edition Dawn of Defiance</a> (<a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/The_Traitor%27s_Gambit\" title=\"The Traitor's Gambit\">The Traitor's Gambit</a>)</i> </p><p><i>See also: <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Hazards\" title=\"Hazards\">Hazards</a></i> </p><p><i>Acid Pools are dangerous hazards on <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Felucia\" title=\"Felucia\">Felucia</a> because they resemble pools of standing water.</i> </p><h2><span id=\"Acid_Pool_Statistics_.28CL_2.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Acid_Pool_Statistics_(CL_2)\">Acid Pool Statistics (CL 2)</span></h2><p><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Keywords\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Keywords\">Keywords</a>:</b> Acid, Contact, Natural </p><p><b>Trigger:</b> A being or object comes into contact with the Acid Pool. </p><p><b>Attack:</b> +2 vs <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Fortitude_Defense\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Fortitude Defense\">Fortitude Defense</a> </p><p><b>Recurrence:</b> Each round at the start of the target's turn, until the acid is washed off or it fails its attack roll. </p><p><b>Suggested <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a>:</b> The following are suggested <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Skills\" title=\"Skills\">Skills</a> for this Hazard: </p><ul>\n <li><b><a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Perception\" title=\"Perception\">Perception</a> (DC 10):</b> The character detects the Acid Pool.</li>\n</ul>",
